'' fbc REGROUPS CONSTANTS IN FLOAT ARITHMETIC before any backend sees the expression, and
'' the regrouped result can differ from left-to-right by a ULP. lowerreassoc.bas models
'' it; the source lists fbc's own C for each shape. The golden pins the rewritten
'' arithmetic -- the accumulated constants and the order the operations are emitted in.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/float-reassoc.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' GOLDEN: expected/float-reassoc.out
